sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Student
  participant Web as Next.js Web
  participant Api as QuizController
  participant Service as QuizService
  participant Enrollment as EnrollmentService
  participant Repo as QuizAttemptRepository
  participant Signal as LearningSignalPublisher

  Student->>Web: Submit quiz answers
  Web->>Api: POST /api/v1/quizzes/{quizId}/attempts
  Api->>Service: submitAttempt(studentId, quizId, answers)
  Service->>Enrollment: Require enrolled student
  Service->>Service: Validate attempt policy and deadline
  Service->>Service: Score objective questions
  Service->>Repo: Save attempt and answers
  Service->>Signal: Append QUIZ_SUBMITTED signal
  Service-->>Api: QuizAttemptResponse
  Api-->>Web: 201 Created
  Web-->>Student: Show result allowed by policy
